    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Techniques\" title=\"Force Techniques\">Force Techniques</a></i> </p><p>When you move a target down the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a> with an attack benefiting from the <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Shatterpoint\" title=\"Shatterpoint\">Shatterpoint</a></i> Force Power, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to make the target's Condition <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent\">Persistent</a>. This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent Condition\">Persistent Condition</a> can only be removed if the target receives <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surgery\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surgery\">Surgery</a> (for living beings) or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Repairs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Repairs\">Repairs</a> (for <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droids\" title=\"Droids\">Droids</a>, objects, and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicles\" title=\"Vehicles\">Vehicles</a>). </p>",
